#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:910
msgid ""
"The bottom area of the second panel, area <guimenu>J</guimenu> in <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>, allows the user to configure the "
"properties of each element in the hierarchy. When there are many properties,"
" they will be grouped into similar sets and placed on different tabs. The "
"detailed explanation of how to configure each property of each element will "
"be explained in <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-elementProperties\"/> below."
msgstr ""
"I den andra panelens nedre del, området <guimenu>J</guimenu> i <xref "
"linkend=\"fig-graphguru-panels\"/>, kan du konfigurera egenskaperna för "
"varje del i hierarkin. Om en del har många egenskaper grupperas de efter "
"ämne på olika flikar. En detaljerad genomgång av hur varje egenskap ställs "
"in finns i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphs-elementProperties\"/> nedan."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:817
msgid ""
"The second panel of the <interface>Graph Guru</interface> only allows two "
"types of actions to be performed: the hierarchy of component elements can be"
" modified or the properties of an element can be altered. "
"<_:variablelist-1/> Once the plot is sufficiently configured, it can be "
"placed on the worksheet to assess its appearance. The user can return to "
"this panel of the <interface>Graph Guru</interface> using the context menu "
"on the graph. The <interface>Graph Guru</interface> is dismissed by clicking"
" on the <guibutton>OK</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"I den andra panelen i <interface>Diagramguiden</interface> kan du göra två "
"saker: ändra hierarkin över grafens delar eller ändra en dels egenskaper. "
"<_:variablelist-1/> När rittypen är tillräckligt konfigurerad kan du placera"
" den i kalkylbladet och bedöma utseendet. Du kan återgå till den här panelen"
" i <interface>Diagramguiden</interface> via grafens snabbmeny. Stäng "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> genom att klicka på "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:937
msgid "Place the graph"
msgstr "Placera grafen"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:938
msgid ""
"After exiting the <interface>Graph Guru</interface>, the user must place the"
" graph on a worksheet. Immediately after exiting the <interface>Graph "
"Guru</interface>, the mouse pointer will have changed to the thin cross-hair"
" cursor. The user can place the graph by moving the pointer over the "
"worksheet and clicking once with the primary mouse button. Alternatively, "
"the user can place and size the graph by determining two of the corners of "
"the graph. This is done by moving the pointer onto the worksheet to the "
"first corner, clicking and holding the primary mouse button, dragging the "
"mouse pointer to the opposite corner and releasing the mouse button."
msgstr ""
"När du har stängt <interface>Diagramguiden</interface> placerar du grafen i "
"ett kalkylblad. Direkt efter att du har stängt "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> ändras muspekaren till ett tunt "
"hårkors. För att placera grafen för du pekaren till önskad plats i "
"kalkylbladet och klickar en gång med den primära musknappen. Du kan också "
"placera grafen och ange dess storlek genom att markera två hörn. För pekaren"
" till det första hörnet, klicka och håll ned den primära musknappen, dra "
"pekaren till det motsatta hörnet och släpp musknappen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:955
msgid "Modifying an existing graph"
msgstr "Ändra en befintlig graf"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:956
msgid ""
"A graph which has already been created can be modified by clicking on the "
"graph with one of the secondary mouse buttons in order to invoke the context"
" menu and then selecting the <guimenuitem>Properties</guimenuitem> menu "
"entry. This will cause the second panel of the <interface>Graph "
"Guru</interface> to appear which will enable the user to make any desired "
"modifications. The use of the context menu was discussed in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-contextmenu\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ändra en befintlig graf genom att klicka på den med en sekundär "
"musknapp för att öppna snabbmenyn och sedan välja "
"<guimenuitem>Egenskaper</guimenuitem>. Då öppnas den andra panelen i "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface>, där du kan göra önskade ändringar. "
"Snabbmenyn beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-graphical-overview-"
"contextmenu\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:970
msgid "Deleting a graph"
msgstr "Ta bort en graf"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:971
msgid ""
"A graph which has been made can be deleted by invoking the context menu and "
"selecting the <guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem> menu item."
msgstr ""
"Ta bort en graf genom att öppna snabbmenyn och välja <guimenuitem>Ta "
"bort</guimenuitem>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:996
msgid "Plot Types"
msgstr "Rittyper"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:998
msgid ""
"<application>Gnumeric</application> graphs can include any of the plot types"
" presented below. The section for each type explains the overall concept of "
"the plot, gives an example, explains the data required for the plot type, "
"and explains the icons in the <interface>Graph Guru</interface> which allow "
"setting the plot sub-type and style."
msgstr ""
"Grafer i <application>Gnumeric</application> kan innehålla alla rittyper som"
" beskrivs nedan. Avsnittet om varje typ förklarar grundprincipen, visar ett "
"exempel och beskriver vilka data som krävs samt ikonerna i "
"<interface>Diagramguiden</interface> där du väljer rittypens undertyp och "
"stil."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1009
msgid "Area Plots"
msgstr "Ytdiagram"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:1013
msgid ""
"Area plots present the numeric values of categorical data with the data "
"values of each series connected by a line and the area below the line "
"shaded. This type is directly analogous to the line plot type. Sequential "
"data values are considered to belong to different categories and are plotted"
" along the horizontal axis at equally spaced intervals. The data values from"
" different series are assigned to these categories based on the position of "
"the value in the series, for example, the second data value taken from each "
"series all share one category. The data values are plotted along the "
"vertical (Y) axis according to their numeric value and the particular sub-"
"type chosen for the area plot."
msgstr ""
"Ytdiagram visar numeriska värden för kategoridata. Värdena i varje dataserie"
" binds samman med en linje och området under linjen fylls med färg. Den här "
"typen fungerar på motsvarande sätt som linjediagram. Värden i följd "
"betraktas som tillhörande olika kategorier och ritas ut med jämna mellanrum "
"längs den vågräta axeln. Värden från olika dataserier kopplas till "
"kategorierna utifrån sin position i serien. Det andra värdet i varje serie "
"tillhör exempelvis samma kategori. Värdena ritas ut längs den lodräta (Y) "
"axeln efter sitt numeriska värde och den valda undertypen för ytdiagrammet."
